      "blockName": "forge-section-1",
      "sectionHtml": "<section data-binding-score=\"0.65\" data-binding=\"ambiguous\" data-figma-node-id=\"10495:77319\" data-block=\"base-card\" style=\"width:100%;background-color:#f2f2f5;overflow:hidden;position:relative;\" data-section-style=\"parallax-featured-card-media\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:768px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;height:851px;\">\n\n    <!-- Lavender Report card (back right, partially off canvas) z=1 -->\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;left:543px;top:276px;width:257px;height:440px;background-color:#dadae7;border-radius:12.8px;transform:rotate(0.62deg);overflow:hidden;z-index:1;padding:20px 18px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:5.5px;font-weight:700;color:#08080b;letter-spacing:0.3px;margin:0 0 3px;\">MARVARD BUSINESS REVISION</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:5.5px;font-weight:700;color:#5a5a87;letter-spacing:0.6px;margin:0 0 8px;text-transform:uppercase;\">Industry Report</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:19.5px;font-weight:600;color:#29293e;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-0.7px;margin:0 0 10px;\">Global Fintech Adoption:<br/>Opportunities<br/>and Risks</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:4.2px;line-height:1.55;color:#29293e;margin:0 0 8px;\">Global fintech adoption has accelerated rapidly over the past decade, driven by widespread smartphone use, improved internet access, and demand for faster, cheaper financial services. Digital wallets, peer-to-peer payments, and online lending platforms have expanded financial inclusion, particularly in regions where traditional banking infrastructure is limited. Emerging markets have often leapfrogged legacy systems, adopting mobile-first solutions that enable millions to access credit, payments, debit, and savings tools for the first time.</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:4.2px;line-height:1.55;color:#29293e;margin:0 0 8px;\">Meanwhile, established financial institutions are being pushed to modernize, partnering with or competing against fintech firms to meet evolving consumer expectations. The opportunities tied to fintech growth are substantial. Businesses benefit from streamlined payment systems, reduced transaction costs, and enhanced data analytics.</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:4.2px;line-height:1.55;color:#29293e;margin:0 0 12px;\">access to capital and enabling small and medium-sized enterprises to scale more efficiently. Innovations such as blockchain, embedded finance, and open banking are also creating new business models and revenue streams, reshaping how financial services are delivered.</div>\n      <!-- Bar chart -->\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:3px;font-weight:700;color:#29293e;margin:0 0 5px;text-align:center;\">Fintech Adoption Index</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-end;height:52px;gap:2px;padding:0 2px;\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:#626294;height:72%;border-radius:1px;opacity:0.75;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:#626294;height:85%;border-radius:1px;opacity:0.75;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:#626294;height:55%;border-radius:1px;opacity:0.75;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:#626294;height:45%;border-radius:1px;opacity:0.75;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:#626294;height:65%;border-radius:1px;opacity:0.75;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:#626294;height:35%;border-radius:1px;opacity:0.75;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:#626294;height:50%;border-radius:1px;opacity:0.75;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:#626294;height:40%;border-radius:1px;opacity:0.75;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:#626294;height:28%;border-radius:1px;opacity:0.75;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:#626294;height:38%;border-radius:1px;opacity:0.75;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:#626294;height:22%;border-radius:1px;opacity:0.75;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:#626294;height:18%;border-radius:1px;opacity:0.75;\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:2px;padding:2px 2px 0;\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:2.5px;color:#626294;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Au</div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:2.5px;color:#626294;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Be</div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:2.5px;color:#626294;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Ch</div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:2.5px;color:#626294;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">De</div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:2.5px;color:#626294;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Ec</div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:2.5px;color:#626294;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Fr</div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:2.5px;color:#626294;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Ge</div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:2.5px;color:#626294;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Hu</div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:2.5px;color:#626294;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Ic</div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:2.5px;color:#626294;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Ke</div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:2.5px;color:#626294;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Ja</div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:2.5px;color:#626294;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">Li</div>\n        </div