">1</span><span style=\"text-align:center;\">1</span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">$5,150</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 18px 18px 40px;gap:2px;padding:4px 0;border-bottom:0.3px solid #2254bd;\">\n            <span>TAXES</span><span></span><span></span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">$550</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:4px 0;border-bottom:0.3px solid #2254bd;margin-bottom:9px;\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:4px;font-weight:700;\">TOTAL</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">$70,150</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Payment terms -->\n        <div style=\"font-size:3px;color:#2254bd;\">\n          <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:3.2px;margin-bottom:2px;\">PAYMENT</div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:5px;\">Payment must be made in full before delivery of any products or services.</div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:3.2px;margin-bottom:2px;\">LATE FEES</div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:5px;\">If payment is not received within 30 days, a late fee of 10% will apply.</div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:3.2px;margin-bottom:2px;\">INCENTIVE</div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:5px;\">2/10 net 30 offers the client a 2% discount if payment is made within 10 business days.</div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:3.2px;margin-bottom:2px;\">CANCELLATION</div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;\">All cancellations must be received in writing at least seven days prior to the scheduled start date. A cancellation fee of 50% will apply.</div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Footer company name -->\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:20px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#2254bd;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.2px;\">MURPHY DESIGN CO.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Black/White Paper + Photo card z=4 -->\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;left:388px;top:340px;width:252px;height:338px;background-color:#f0f0f0;border-radius:12.8px;transform:rotate(0.32deg);overflow:hidden;z-index:4;padding:5px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n      <!-- Decorative vector on outer light frame -->\n      <img src=\"./media_42f8f2f649ba2b5d.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:55%;height:auto;opacity:0.45;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;\" />\n      <!-- Inner black frame -->\n      <div style=\"background:#000000;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative;z-index:1;\">\n        <!-- Photo fill: colorful H graphic (upper portion) -->\n        <img src=\"./media_81f2d91b52725cb4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:196px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top;display:block;flex-shrink:0;\" />\n        <!-- White Paper text area (lower portion) -->\n        <div style=\"padding:13px 17px 18px;flex:1;box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;\">\n          <!-- Vector decoration within dark frame -->\n          <img src=\"./media_f724476478c4d513.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;width:58%;height:auto;opacity:0.3;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;\" />\n          <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Arial Black',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:#f0f0f0;line-height:0.98;letter-spacing:-0.3px;margin-bottom:8px;\">White Paper</div>\n            <div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:6.2px;color:#f0f0f0;line-height:1.75;\">Think Tank<br/>info@monobloc.com<br/>monobloc.com</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Media Mix card (front center) z=5 -->\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;left:202px;top:182px;width:290px;height:393px;background-color:#abdde8;border-radius:12.8px;transform:rotate(-0.5deg);overflow:hidden;z-index:5;box-sizing:border-box;box-shadow:0 1.3px 2.1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05),0 3.2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.08),0 6.1px 9.4px rgba(0,0,0,0.09),0 10.8px 16.8px rgba(0,0,0,0.11),0 20.3px 31.4px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0 48.5px 75.2px rgba(0,0,0,0.19);\">\n      <!-- Decorative circle -->\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;top:14px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;border:0.36px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.45);z-index:2;pointer-events:none;\"></div>\n      <!-- Content -->\n      <div style=\"padding:14px;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n        <!-- Tab buttons -->\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:5px;margin-bottom:12px;flex-shrink:0;\">\n          <div style=\"background:#3d5572;border-radius:2.84px;padding:2.5px 7px;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-shrink:0;\">\n            <span style=\"font-family:monospace,sans-serif;font-size:6.9px;color:#abdde8;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.25px;white-space:nowrap;\">MEDIA</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"border:0.47px solid #3d5572;border-radius:2.84px;padding:2.5px 7px;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-shrink:0;\">\n            <span style=\"font-family:monospace,sans-serif;font-size:6.9px;color:#3d5572;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.25px;white-space:nowrap;\">Q3 MIX</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Title -->\n        <div style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;font-weight:600;color:#3d5572;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:-0.4px;flex-shrink:0;\">Quarterly Media Mix<br/>FY2026 Q3</div>\n        <!-- Separator -->\n        <div style=\"height:0.5px;background:#3d5572;opacity:0.2;margin-bottom:11px;flex-shrink:0;\"></div>\n        <!-- Bar chart: proportional horizontal bars, equal height, stacked top→bottom -->\n        <div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-height:0;\">\n          <!-- Digital 56% — full width, darkest -->\n          <div style=\"flex:1;width:100%;background:#3d5572;border-radius:2px;padding:8px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:7.2px;color:#abdde8;line-height:1.4;\">Digital<br/>56%</div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- OOH 18% -->\n          <div style=\"flex:1;width:57%;background:#40739b;border-radius:2px;padding:8px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:7.2px;color:#abdde8;line-height:1.4;\">OOH<br/>18%</div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- CTV 9% -->\n          <div style=\"flex:1;width:40%;background:#588cb4;border-radius:2px;padding:8px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:7.2px;color:#abdde8;line-height:1.4;\">CTV<br/>9%</div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- Events 8% — lightest, dark text -->\n          <div style=\"flex:1;width:37%;background:#a5bdcf;border-radius:2px;padding:8px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:7.2px;color:#3d5572;line-height:1.4;\">Events<br/>8%</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>",
      "authorContentHtml": "MARVARD BUSINESS REVISION\n      Industry Report\n      Global Fintech Adoption:<br>Opportunities<br>and Risks\n      Global fintech adoption has accelerated rapidly over the past decade, driven by widespread smartphone use, improved internet access, and demand for faster, cheaper financial services. Digital wallets, peer-to-peer payments, and online lending platforms have expanded financial inclusion, particularly in regions where traditional banking infrastructure is limited. Emerging markets have often leapfrogged legacy systems, adopting mobile-first solutions that enable millions to access credit, payments, debit, and savings tools for the first time.\n      Meanwhile, established financial institutions are being pushed to modernize, partnering with or competing against fintech firms to meet evolving consumer expectations. The opportunities tied to fintech growth are substantial. Businesses benefit from streamlined payment systems, reduced transaction costs, and enhanced data analytics.\n      access to capital and enabling small and medium-sized enterprises to scale more efficiently. Innovations such as blockchain, embedded finance, and open banking are also creating new business models and revenue streams, reshaping how financial services are delivered.\nFintech Adoption Index\nAu\n          Be\n          Ch\n          De\n          Ec\n          Fr\n          Ge\n          Hu\n          Ic\n          Ke\n          Ja\n          Li\nINVOICE\n            MURPHY DESIGN CO.\nINFO\n            FROM\n            TO\n            BANK\n            FOR INQUIRIES\n            MURPHYDESIGN.CO\nRYAN MURPHY\n            FOUNDER\n            123 STATE STREET\n            NEW YORK 12345\n            @MURPHYDESIGN\nMAX'S HOMEMADE\n            CUPCAKES\n            12 BRIDLE LANE\n            BROOKLYN, NY\n            13052\nCHAISE BANK N.A.\n            ACCOUNT\n            1234151075392026\n            SWIFT CODE\n            ABCD1241295013\nDescriptionQtyHoursSubtotal\nPARENT REBRAND11$12,450\nSS26 CAMPAIGN11$52,000\nQUARTERLY SOCIAL MEDIA PLAN11$5,150\nTAXES$550\nTOTAL\n            $70,150\nPAYMENT\n          Payment must be made in full before delivery of any products or services.\n          LATE FEES\n          If payment is not received within 30 days, a late fee of 10% will apply.\n          INCENTIVE\n          2/10 net 30 offers the client a 2% discount if payment is made within 10 business days.\n          CANCELLATION\n          All cancellations must be received in writing at least seven days prior to the scheduled start date. A cancellation fee of 50% will apply.\nMURPHY DESIGN CO.\n<picture><img src=\"./media_42f8f2f649ba2b5d.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"./media_81f2d91b52725cb4.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"./media_f724476478c4d513.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\nWhite Paper\n            Think Tank<br>info@monobloc.com<br>monobloc.com\nMEDIA\nQ3 MIX\nQuarterly Media Mix<br>FY2026 Q3\nDigital<br>56%\nOOH<br>18%\nCTV<br>9%\nEvents<br>8%",
