      "sectionHtml": "<section data-binding-source=\"judge\" data-binding-variants=\"default\" data-binding-score=\"0.85\" data-binding=\"tight-variant\" data-figma-node-id=\"10495:76631\" data-block=\"news\" style=\"width:100%;background-color:#f6f6f6;\">\n<style>\n.wn-wrap{max-width:768px;margin:0 auto;padding:80px 65px 124px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:24px;}\n.wn-row{display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:8px;width:100%;}\n.wn-col{flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}\n.wn-card-img{width:100%;display:block;border-radius:16px;object-fit:cover;background:#e4e4e4;flex-shrink:0;}\n.wn-placeholder{width:100%;height:294px;border-radius:16px;background:#c4c4c4;flex-shrink:0;}\n.wn-copy1{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:16px 16px 0 16px;}\n.wn-copy2{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;padding:24px 16px 0 16px;}\n.wn-hb{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}\n.wn-h3{margin:0;font-family:'Adobe Clean Display',adobe-clean-display,'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,serif;font-weight:900;font-size:18px;line-height:18px;letter-spacing:-0.48px;color:#000;}\n.wn-body{margin:0;font-family:'Adobe Clean',adobe-clean,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.64);}\n.wn-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;text-decoration:none;margin-top:0;}\n.wn-cta-label{font-family:'Adobe Clean',adobe-clean,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;line-height:18px;color:#000;}\n.wn-sk-dark{background:rgba(0,0,0,0.22);border-radius:3px;}\n.wn-sk-light{background:rgba(0,0,0,0.13);border-radius:3px;}\n@media(max-width:768px){\n  .wn-wrap{padding:80px 65px 124px;}\n}\n@media(max-width:540px){\n  .wn-wrap{padding:48px 20px 80px;}\n  .wn-row{flex-direction:column;}\n  .wn-wrap h2{font-size:36px!important;line-height:38px!important;}\n}\n</style>\n<div class=\"wn-wrap\">\n\n  <!-- Section heading -->\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:100%;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Adobe Clean',adobe-clean,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.64);\">Features and Releases</p>\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Adobe Clean Display',adobe-clean-display,'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,serif;font-weight:900;font-size:48px;line-height:48px;letter-spacing:-1.44px;text-align:center;color:#000;max-width:640px;\">There’s always something new with Acrobat.</h1>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Row 1: three feature cards with photograph fills -->\n  <div class=\"wn-row\">\n\n    <!-- Column 1 — PDF to Podcast -->\n    <div class=\"wn-col\">\n      <img src=\"./media_8cc9d5a724e41793.png\" alt=\"Generate Podcast UI screenshot\" class=\"wn-card-img\" style=\"height:157px;\" />\n      <div class=\"wn-copy1\">\n        <div class=\"wn-hb\">\n          <h2 class=\"wn-h3\">PDF to Podcast</h2>\n          <p class=\"wn-body\">Convert any PDF into audio playback, with options to hear a quick overview or a complete narration.</p>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"wn-cta\">\n          <span class=\"wn-cta-label\">Learn more</span>\n          <svg width=\"5\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 5 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M1 1L4 4.5L1 8\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" ></path>\n          </svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 2 — One-click Brand Kit Setup -->\n    <div class=\"wn-col\">\n      <img src=\"./media_f6ea10f050cd2831.png\" alt=\"Colorful brand kit grid with logos and gradients\" class=\"wn-card-img\" style=\"height:156px;\" />\n      <div class=\"wn-copy2\">\n        <div class=\"wn-hb\">\n          <h3 class=\"wn-h3\">One-click Brand Kit Setup</h3>\n          <p class=\"wn-body\">Set up a complete brand kit in a single click by automatically extracting logos, colors, and fonts from existing content.</p>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"wn-cta\">\n          <span class=\"wn-cta-label\">Learn more</span>\n          <svg width=\"5\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 5 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M1 1L4 4.5L1 8\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" ></path>\n          </svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 3 — AI-Powered Video Highlights -->\n    <div class=\"wn-col\">\n      <img src=\"./media_35513f76de77f49c.png\" alt=\"AI video highlight reel showing multiple phone frames\" class=\"wn-card-img\" style=\"height:156px;\" />\n      <div class=\"wn-copy2\">\n        <div class=\"wn-hb\" style=\"min-height:154px;\">\n          <h3 class=\"wn-h3\">AI-Powered Video Highlights</h3>\n          <p class=\"wn-body\">Upload any video and let Adobe Express automatically find the highlights, add captions, and export in any aspect ratio.</p>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"wn-cta\">\n          <span class=\"wn-cta-label\">Learn more</span>\n          <svg width=\"5\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 5 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M1 1L4 4.5L1 8\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" ></path>\n          </svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div><!-- /row 1 -->\n\n  <!-- Row 2: three larger feature cards (desktop-wide design, adapted to container) -->\n  <div class=\"wn-row\">\n\n    <!-- Column 1 -->\n    <div class=\"wn-col\">\n      <div class=\"wn-placeholder\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wn-copy2\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;\">\n          <img src=\"./media_1bb1a4cdf515319b.png\" alt=\"Headline\" style=\"width:min(286px,100%);height:auto;display:block;object-fit:contain;object-position:left center;\" />\n          <!-- sub-headline skeleton -->\n          <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;\">\n            <div class=\"wn-sk-light\" style=\"height:10px;width:100%;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"wn-sk-light\" style=\"height:10px;width:68%;\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <img src=\"./media_efa5484335caa9f5.png\" alt=\"Learn more\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;\" />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 2 -->\n    <div class=\"wn-col\">\n      <div class=\"wn-placeholder\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wn-copy2\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;\">\n          <!-- headline skeleton -->\n          <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-height:45px;justify-content:center;\">\n            <div class=\"wn-sk-dark\" style=\"height:13px;width:90%;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"wn-sk-dark\" style=\"height:13px;width:64%;\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- body skeleton -->\n          <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-height:36px;justify-content:center;\">\n            <div class=\"wn-sk-light\" style=\"height:10px;width:100%;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"wn-sk-light\" style=\"height:10px;width:76%;\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <img src=\"./media_99558f8050357e4d.png\" alt=\"Learn more\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;\" />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 3 -->\n    <div class=\"wn-col\">\n      <div class=\"wn-placeholder\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wn-copy2\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;\">\n          <!-- headline skeleton -->\n          <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-height:41px;justify-content:center;\">\n            <div class=\"wn-sk-dark\" style=\"height:13px;width:84%;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"wn-sk-dark\" style=\"height:13px;width:58%;\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <img src=\"./media_38db1294fe8a4964.png\" alt=\"Sub headline\" style=\"width:min(247px,100%);height:auto;display:block;object-fit:contain;object-position:left center;\" />\n        </div>\n        <img src=\"./media_b26bd6b843a65ee2.png\" alt=\"Learn more\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;\" />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div><!-- /row 2 -->\n\n</div>\n</section>",
      "authorContentHtml": "<p>Features and Releases</p>\n    <h1>There’s always something new with Acrobat.</h1>\n<picture><img src=\"./media_8cc9d5a724e41793.png\" alt=\"Generate Podcast UI screenshot\"></picture>\n<h2>PDF to Podcast</h2>\n          <p>Convert any PDF into audio playback, with options to hear a quick overview or a complete narration.</p>\n<a href=\"#\">\n          Learn more\n</a>\n<picture><img src=\"./media_f6ea10f050cd2831.png\" alt=\"Colorful brand kit grid with logos and gradients\"></picture>\n<h3>One-click Brand Kit Setup</h3>\n          <p>Set up a complete brand kit in a single click by automatically extracting logos, colors, and fonts from existing content.</p>\n<a href=\"#\">\n          Learn more\n</a>\n<picture><img src=\"./media_35513f76de77f49c.png\" alt=\"AI video highlight reel showing multiple phone frames\"></picture>\n<h3>AI-Powered Video Highlights</h3>\n          <p>Upload any video and let Adobe Express automatically find the highlights, add captions, and export in any aspect ratio.</p>\n<a href=\"#\">\n          Learn more\n</a>\n<picture><img src=\"./media_1bb1a4cdf515319b.png\" alt=\"Headline\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"./media_efa5484335caa9f5.png\" alt=\"Learn more\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"./media_99558f8050357e4d.png\" alt=\"Learn more\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"./media_38db1294fe8a4964.png\" alt=\"Sub headline\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"./media_b26bd6b843a65ee2.png\" alt=\"Learn more\"></picture>",
